(   - Earthing Sticks: Before entering the cage after test completion, technicians must physically) Tj
T*
(   touch the high-voltage electrode with an earthing discharge stick to drain residual) Tj
T*
(   electrostatic charges.) Tj
T*
(   - Dielectric rubber safety matting \(IS 15652\) is installed along all operator control consoles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
