(>> Solution to Question 3:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the equipment, converter topologies, and experimental studies in the Power Electronics & Electric Drives Laboratory.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Power Electronics & Electric Drives Laboratory:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Experimental Rigs & Converters:) Tj
T*
(   - Phase-Controlled Rectifiers: Single-phase and 3-phase fully-controlled SCR bridges with) Tj
T*
(   resistive and inductive \($R-L-E$\) loads.) Tj
T*
(   - DC-DC Choppers: MOSFET and IGBT buck, boost, buck-boost, and four-quadrant H-bridge) Tj
T*
(   converters.) Tj
T*
(   - DC-AC Inverters: 3-phase Voltage Source Inverters \(VSI\) using IGBT power modules driven by) Tj
T*
(   Space Vector PWM.) Tj
T*
(   - AC Voltage Controllers & Cycloconverters.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. DSP / Microcontroller Interfacing:) Tj
T*
(   Students interface Texas Instruments C2000 DSP or STM32 microcontrollers with power stages) Tj
T*
(   through optoisolated gate drivers, observing complementary gate signals, dead-time insertion) Tj
T*
(   \(typically 1-2 microseconds\), and closed-loop speed regulation of DC and induction motor) Tj
T*
(   drives.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 4:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the instrumentation, transducers, and feedback control experiments in the Control & Instrumentation Laboratory.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Control & Instrumentation Laboratory:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Sensor Characterization Benches:) Tj
T*
(   - Temperature: Thermocouples \(J, K type\), Pt100 RTDs, and thermistors evaluated in a) Tj
T*
(   temperature-controlled heating bath.) Tj
T*
(   - Displacement: Linear Variable Differential Transformer \(LVDT\) calibrated against a micrometer) Tj
T*
(   spindle.) Tj
T*
(   - Strain: Four-arm Wheatstone bridge with bonded foil strain gauges mounted on a cantilever) Tj
T*
(   beam.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Feedback Control Benches:) Tj
T*
(   - Synchro Transmitter-Receiver pair configured as an error detector.) Tj
T*
(   - AC and DC Servomotor position control systems.) Tj
T*
(   - Analog and Digital PID Controllers tuning proportional, integral, and derivative gains \($K_p,) Tj
T*
(   K_i, K_d$\) for temperature and liquid level regulation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
