T*
(   1. IEEE Power & Energy Society \(IEEE PES\) Student Chapter:) Tj
T*
(   Organizes technical seminars on smart grids, grid modernization, and renewable energy.) Tj
T*
(   Facilitates participation in the IEEE PES General Meeting and Student Design Competitions,) Tj
T*
(   providing access to IEEE Xplore digital library research papers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. IEEE Industry Applications Society \(IEEE IAS\):) Tj
T*
(   Focuses on industrial electrification, motor drives, mining, and factory automation, organizing) Tj
T*
(   industrial tours to substations and manufacturing plants.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. IEEE Power Electronics Society \(IEEE PELS\):) Tj
T*
(   Conducts hands-on hardware hackathons on EV inverters, wide-bandgap semiconductors, and) Tj
T*
(   switch-mode power supplies, cultivating practical hardware prototyping skills.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
