T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the Institution of Engineers \(India\) - IEI: History, student chapters, chartered engineer status, and professional ethics.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Institution of Engineers \(India\) - IEI:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Historical Heritage:) Tj
T*
(   Established in 1920 and incorporated by Royal Charter in 1935, the IEI is the apex professional) Tj
T*
(   body representing engineering disciplines across India with over one million members.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Student Chapters:) Tj
T*
(   IEI student chapters at universities organize national conventions, technical paper) Tj
T*
(   presentation contests, and design competitions, fostering professional identity and) Tj
T*
(   multidisciplinary collaboration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Chartered Engineer \(India\) Certification:) Tj
T*
(   Corporate members possessing verified professional experience are eligible for the 'Chartered) Tj
T*
(   Engineer \(CEng\)' title, authorizing them to certify machinery valuation, structural integrity,) Tj
T*
(   and industrial export/import compliance under government regulations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
