(   1. Academic Honesty Standards:) Tj
T*
(   Universities enforce strict anti-plagiarism guidelines governing laboratory reports, term) Tj
T*
(   papers, and capstone design theses. Submissions must undergo automated plagiarism detection) Tj
T*
