(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the test procedure for the measurement of earth resistance using a four-terminal earth ground tester.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Four-Terminal Earth Resistance Testing \(Wenner Method, IEEE Std 81\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Wenner Four-Pin Array: Four electrodes \($C_1, P_1, P_2, C_2$\) are driven into the soil along) Tj
T*
(   a straight line spaced at equal distances $a$.) Tj
T*
(   2. Soil Resistivity Calculation: An alternating test current $I$ is injected between outer pins) Tj
T*
(   $C_1$ and $C_2$. The resulting potential difference $V$ across inner pins $P_1$ and $P_2$ is) Tj
T*
(   measured:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\rho = 2 \\pi a \\frac{V}{I} = 2 \\pi a R$$) Tj
T*
(   By varying pin spacing $a$, engineers map soil resistivity profiles at varying depths, which is) Tj
T*
(   essential for designing safe substation earthing grids.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 12:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the principles of open-circuit and short-circuit testing on a single-phase transformer to derive its equivalent circuit.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Transformer Equivalent Circuit Extraction:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Open-Circuit \(No-Load\) Test: Conducted on Low-Voltage \(LV\) winding with High-Voltage \(HV\)) Tj
T*
(   open at rated voltage $V_0$. Measures $V_0, I_0, W_0$:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\cos\\phi_0 = \\frac{W_0}{V_0 I_0}, \\quad R_c = \\frac{V_0}{I_0 \\cos\\phi_0}, \\quad X_m =) Tj
T*
(   \\frac{V_0}{I_0 \\sin\\phi_0}$$) Tj
T*
(   Yields core loss resistance $R_c$ and magnetizing reactance $X_m$.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Short-Circuit Test: Conducted on HV winding with LV shorted at reduced voltage $V_{sc}$ to) Tj
T*
(   circulate rated current $I_{sc}$. Measures $V_{sc}, I_{sc}, W_{sc}$:) Tj
T*
(   $$R_{eq} = \\frac{W_{sc}}{I_{sc}^2}, \\quad Z_{eq} = \\frac{V_{sc}}{I_{sc}}, \\quad X_{eq} =) Tj
T*
(   \\sqrt{Z_{eq}^2 - R_{eq}^2}$$) Tj
T*
(   Yields equivalent winding resistance $R_{eq}$ and leakage reactance $X_{eq}$.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
