T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   VFD Laboratory Safety Protocols:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Stored DC Bus Hazard: VFD internal DC bus capacitor banks store lethal high-voltage energy) Tj
T*
(   \($> 600\\text{ V DC}$\) that remains energized for several minutes AFTER disconnecting main AC) Tj
T*
(   power. Personnel must measure the DC bus terminals with a multimeter and verify voltage $<) Tj
T*
(   10\\text{ V}$ before servicing.) Tj
T*
(   2. Motor Grounding: High $dv/dt$ PWM pulses induce high-frequency common-mode voltages on motor) Tj
T*
(   frames, requiring dedicated braided copper earth bonding.) Tj
T*
() Tj
