T*
(   disclose promptly factors that might endanger the public or the environment.') Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Case Analysis \(Flint Water Crisis / Ford Pinto Case\):) Tj
T*
(   Engineers who identify catastrophic safety defects \(e.g., inadequate transformer grounding,) Tj
T*
(   compromised protective relay logic\) have an absolute ethical duty to escalate concerns.) Tj
T*
(   Corporate cost-cutting never excuses releasing electrically hazardous equipment that risks) Tj
T*
(   public life.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
