(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the safety and operational protocols for charging and discharging high-voltage Marx generators.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Marx Generator Safety Protocol:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Pre-Check: Verify all personnel are outside the perimeter interlock fence. Energize the) Tj
T*
(   safety warning siren and flashing red beacon.) Tj
T*
(   2. Charging Phase: DC charging voltage is raised smoothly via a high-voltage rectifier.) Tj
T*
(   3. Triggering & Discharge: Trigger spark gap is fired. Intermediate spark gaps flash over) Tj
T*
(   simultaneously, discharging capacitors in series across test insulator.) Tj
T*
(   4. Post-Discharge: The automatic mechanical grounding arm drops, shorting all capacitor stages) Tj
T*
(   to ground before fence entry is unlocked.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
