(   [Problem Statement]: Summarize the defining attributes of a modern, ethical, and socially conscious professional Electrical Engineer.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   The Professional Electrical Engineer:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   A modern electrical engineer represents the synthesis of analytical rigor, experimental) Tj
T*
(   mastery, and profound societal responsibility:) Tj
T*
(   1. Scientific Competence: Mastering mathematical physics, power systems, power electronics,) Tj
T*
(   embedded computing, and digital control.) Tj
T*
(   2. Sustainable Innovation: Directing engineering intellect toward renewable energy integration,) Tj
T*
(   energy efficiency, clean mobility \(EVs\), and decarbonization.) Tj
T*
(   3. Uncompromising Ethics: Holding public safety paramount, designing transparent, fail-safe) Tj
T*
(   systems, mentoring younger engineers, and honoring the noble calling of the engineering) Tj
T*
(   profession.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
